'''Hangar 12''' was a [[hangar]] in the [[First Order]] [[flagship]] [[Steadfast (Resurgent-class)|''Steadfast'']].<ref name="Ep9" /> In [[35 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> during the [[Mission to Kijimi]], [[Resistance]] members [[Finn]], [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] and [[Poe Dameron]] landed the ''[[Bestoon Legacy]]'' in the hangar, using a [[First Order transit data-medallion|First Order Captain's Medallion]] to get clearance. The team split up, with Finn and Dameron trying to rescue [[Chewbacca]]. Later, [[Ben Solo|Kylo Ren]] confronted Rey in the hangar, asking her to be his ally. Rey refused and the team escaped by her jumping onto the ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'', which Finn and Dameron were able to retrieve from a different hangar.<ref name="Ep9" />

